Description: ebdt calculate Sensitivity, Specificity, positive and negative predictive 
    value, positive and negative Likelihood Ratio, Weighted Kappa coefficient, a global 
    diagnostic accuracy index, prevalence and their Confidence intervals in a traverse 
    or Cross-sectional study, and Sensitivity, Specificity, positive and negative  
    Likelihood Ratio and a global diagnostic accuracy index in a Case Control or 
    Retrospective study.
